  "$id": "https://fynkel.dev/schemas/prefab.schema.json",
  "$comment": "GENERATED by `fynkel codegen` from the document model and the Rust component schemas (ADR-0012). Do not edit.",
  "title": "Fynkel prefab document",
  "description": "The scene entity model plus declared `roots` (blueprint §6 Prefabs). An entity with `prefab` is a nested prefab instance, expanded when the prefab is (a cycle is `FYN-D0402`). `fynkel prefab validate` checks the semantic rules.",
  "type": "object",
